# Optional public Google OAuth 2.0 Web Client ID for client-side Google Sign-In
# and Google Drive cloud save sync via Google Identity Services (zero backend servers, zero Firebase).
# Create a Web Application OAuth Client ID in Google Cloud Console and add
# your authorized JavaScript origins (e.g. https://capyboop.com and http://localhost:3000).
# Never place a client secret or private API key here.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
